{"id":"01a0657e-0245-7c66-bb13-ef706f6a9d15","chapterSlug":"rw7-18 M","paragraph":744,"wording":"[Rider]","event":"named","holderSlug":"tritel","holderQuote":"The mare snorted. Her sides had deflected a few projectiles. Worried, Tritel checked her. She had an [Enhanced Hide] Skill, but she was bleeding. The [Rider] shouted in fury as he looked ahead at the [Riders] shooting at them."}
{"id":"01a0657e-0245-7ef9-9cca-d834b5bd6940","chapterSlug":"rw7-18 M","paragraph":835,"wording":"[Rider]","event":"named","holderSlug":"tritel","holderQuote":"Hawk glanced at Salamani. The [Mage] poked Tritel. The [Rider] elbowed Ci. The mare snorted and nodded. They backed away as Noass and the crowd and the Zolde family became the center of another drama. Because that was news, right?"}
